{"number":75,"nameArabic":"سُورَةُ القِيَامَةِ","nameEnglish":"Al-Qiyaama","englishMeaning":"The Resurrection","revelationType":"Meccan","totalVerses":40,"audioUrl":"https://server8.mp3quran.net/afs/075.mp3","ayahs":[{"numberInSurah":1,"globalNumber":5552,"arabic":"بِسْمِ ٱللَّهِ ٱلرَّحْمَٰنِ ٱلرَّحِيمِ لَآ أُقْسِمُ بِيَوْمِ ٱلْقِيَٰمَةِ","translation":"I swear by the Day of Resurrection","transliteration":"Laaa uqsimu bi yawmil qiyaamah","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5552.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":2,"globalNumber":5553,"arabic":"وَلَآ أُقْسِمُ بِٱلنَّفْسِ ٱللَّوَّامَةِ","translation":"And I swear by the reproaching soul [to the certainty of resurrection].","transliteration":"Wa laaa uqsimu bin nafsil lawwaamah","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5553.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":3,"globalNumber":5554,"arabic":"أَيَحْسَبُ ٱلْإِنسَٰنُ أَلَّن نَّجْمَعَ عِظَامَهُۥ","translation":"Does man think that We will not assemble his bones?","transliteration":"Ayahsabul insaanu al lan najm'a 'izaamah","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5554.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":4,"globalNumber":5555,"arabic":"بَلَىٰ قَٰدِرِينَ عَلَىٰٓ أَن نُّسَوِّىَ بَنَانَهُۥ","translation":"Yes. [We are] Able [even] to proportion his fingertips.","transliteration":"Balaa qaadireena 'alaaa an nusawwiya banaanah","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5555.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":5,"globalNumber":5556,"arabic":"بَلْ يُرِيدُ ٱلْإِنسَٰنُ لِيَفْجُرَ أَمَامَهُۥ","translation":"But man desires to continue in sin.","transliteration":"Bal yureedul insaanu liyafjura amaamah","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5556.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":6,"globalNumber":5557,"arabic":"يَسْـَٔلُ أَيَّانَ يَوْمُ ٱلْقِيَٰمَةِ","translation":"He asks, \"When is the Day of Resurrection?\"","transliteration":"Yas'alu ayyyaana yawmul qiyaamah","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5557.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":7,"globalNumber":5558,"arabic":"فَإِذَا بَرِقَ ٱلْبَصَرُ","translation":"So when vision is dazzled","transliteration":"Fa izaa bariqal basar","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5558.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":8,"globalNumber":5559,"arabic":"وَخَسَفَ ٱلْقَمَرُ","translation":"And the moon darkens","transliteration":"We khasafal qamar","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5559.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":9,"globalNumber":5560,"arabic":"وَجُمِعَ ٱلشَّمْسُ وَٱلْقَمَرُ","translation":"And the sun and the moon are joined,","transliteration":"Wa jumi'ash shamusu wal qamar","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5560.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":10,"globalNumber":5561,"arabic":"يَقُولُ ٱلْإِنسَٰنُ يَوْمَئِذٍ أَيْنَ ٱلْمَفَرُّ","translation":"Man will say on that Day, \"Where is the [place of] escape?\"","transliteration":"Yaqoolul insaanu yaw ma 'izin aynal mafarr","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5561.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":11,"globalNumber":5562,"arabic":"كَلَّا لَا وَزَرَ","translation":"No! There is no refuge.","transliteration":"Kallaa laa wazar","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5562.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":12,"globalNumber":5563,"arabic":"إِلَىٰ رَبِّكَ يَوْمَئِذٍ ٱلْمُسْتَقَرُّ","translation":"To your Lord, that Day, is the [place of] permanence.","transliteration":"Ilaa rabbika yawma 'izinil mustaqarr","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5563.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":13,"globalNumber":5564,"arabic":"يُنَبَّؤُا۟ ٱلْإِنسَٰنُ يَوْمَئِذٍۭ بِمَا قَدَّمَ وَأَخَّرَ","translation":"Man will be informed that Day of what he sent ahead and kept back.","transliteration":"Yunabba 'ul insaanu yawma 'izim bimaa qaddama wa akhkhar","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5564.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":14,"globalNumber":5565,"arabic":"بَلِ ٱلْإِ