alafasy/5571.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":21,"globalNumber":5572,"arabic":"وَتَذَرُونَ ٱلْءَاخِرَةَ","translation":"And leave the Hereafter.","transliteration":"Wa tazaroonal Aakhirah","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5572.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":22,"globalNumber":5573,"arabic":"وُجُوهٌۭ يَوْمَئِذٍۢ نَّاضِرَةٌ","translation":"[Some] faces, that Day, will be radiant,","transliteration":"Wujoohuny yawma 'izin naadirah","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5573.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":23,"globalNumber":5574,"arabic":"إِلَىٰ رَبِّهَا نَاظِرَةٌۭ","translation":"Looking at their Lord.","transliteration":"Ilaa rabbihaa naazirah","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5574.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":24,"globalNumber":5575,"arabic":"وَوُجُوهٌۭ يَوْمَئِذٍۭ بَاسِرَةٌۭ","translation":"And [some] faces, that Day, will be contorted,","transliteration":"Wa wujoohuny yawma 'izim baasirah","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5575.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":25,"globalNumber":5576,"arabic":"تَظُنُّ أَن يُفْعَلَ بِهَا فَاقِرَةٌۭ","translation":"Expecting that there will be done to them [something] backbreaking.","transliteration":"Tazunnu any yuf'ala bihaa faaqirah","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5576.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":26,"globalNumber":5577,"arabic":"كَلَّآ إِذَا بَلَغَتِ ٱلتَّرَاقِىَ","translation":"No! When the soul has reached the collar bones","transliteration":"Kallaaa izaa balaghatit taraaqee","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5577.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":27,"globalNumber":5578,"arabic":"وَقِيلَ مَنْ ۜ رَاقٍۢ","translation":"And it is said, \"Who will cure [him]?\"","transliteration":"Wa qeela man raaq","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5578.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":28,"globalNumber":5579,"arabic":"وَظَنَّ أَنَّهُ ٱلْفِرَاقُ","translation":"And the dying one is certain that it is the [time of] separation","transliteration":"Wa zanna annahul firaaq","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5579.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":29,"globalNumber":5580,"arabic":"وَٱلْتَفَّتِ ٱلسَّاقُ بِٱلسَّاقِ","translation":"And the leg is wound about the leg,","transliteration":"Waltaffatis saaqu bissaaq","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5580.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":30,"globalNumber":5581,"arabic":"إِلَىٰ رَبِّكَ يَوْمَئِذٍ ٱلْمَسَاقُ","translation":"To your Lord, that Day, will be the procession.","transliteration":"Ilaa rabbika yawma'izinil masaaq","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5581.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":31,"globalNumber":5582,"arabic":"فَلَا صَدَّقَ وَلَا صَلَّىٰ","translation":"And the disbeliever had not believed, nor had he prayed.","transliteration":"Falaa saddaqa wa laa sallaa","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5582.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":32,"globalNumber":5583,"arabic":"وَلَٰكِن كَذَّبَ وَتَوَلَّىٰ","translation":"But [instead], he denied and turned away.","transliteration":"Wa laakin kazzaba wa tawalla","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5583.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":33,"globalNumber":5584,"arabic":"ثُمَّ ذَهَبَ إِلَىٰٓ أَهْلِهِۦ يَتَمَطَّىٰٓ","translation":"And then he went to his people, swaggering [in pride].","transliteration":"Summa zahaba ilaaa ahlihee yatamatta","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5584.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":34,"globalNumber":5585,"arabic":"أَوْلَىٰ لَكَ فَأَوْلَىٰ","translation":"Woe to you, and woe!","transliteration":"Awlaa laka fa awlaa","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5585.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":35,"globalNumber":5586,"arabic":"ثُمَّ أَوْلَىٰ لَكَ فَأَوْلَىٰٓ","translation":"Then woe to you, and woe!","transliteration":"Summa awlaa laka fa awla","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5586.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":36,"globalNumber":5587,"arabic":"أَيَحْسَبُ ٱلْإِنسَٰنُ أَن يُتْرَكَ سُدًى","translation":"Does man think that he will be left neglected?","transliteration":"Ayahsabul insaanu anyytraka sudaa","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5587.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":37,"globalNumber":5588,"arabic":"أَلَمْ يَكُ نُطْفَةًۭ مِّن مَّنِىٍّۢ يُمْنَىٰ","translation":"Had he not been a sperm from semen emitted?","transliteration":"Alam yaku nutfatam mim maniyyiny yumnaa","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5588.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":38,"globalNumber":5589,"arabic":"ثُمَّ كَانَ عَلَقَةًۭ فَخَلَقَ فَسَوَّىٰ","translation":"Then he was a clinging clot, and [Allah] created [his form] and proportioned [him]","transliteration":"Summa kaana 'alaqata fakhalaq fasawwaa","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5589.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":39,"globalNumber":5590,"arabic":"فَجَعَلَ مِنْهُ ٱلزَّوْجَيْنِ ٱلذَّكَرَ وَٱلْأُنثَىٰٓ","translation":"And made of him two mates, the male and the female.","transliteration":"Faja'ala minhuz zawjayniz zakara wal unsaa","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5590.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":40,"globalNumber":5591,"arabic":"أَلَيْسَ ذَٰلِكَ بِقَٰدِرٍ عَلَىٰٓ أَن يُحْۦِىَ ٱلْمَوْتَىٰ","translation":"Is not that [Creator] Able to give life to the dead?","transliteration":"Alaisa zaalika biqaadirin 'alaaa any yuhyiyal mawtaa","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5591.mp3"}]}